      "title": "GitLab CI: Distinguish between plain and merge train merge requests",
      "message": "GitLab CI: Distinguish between plain and merge train merge requests\n\nAdd an \"if-plain-merge-request\" rule and apply it to some jobs that we\ndon't need to run a second time as part of a merge train.\n\nThe \"Clang + Code Checks\" takes a while to run, so remove its dependency\non the \"Commit Check\" job.\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
